            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Kipowi 0.7.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Drag across the waveform to mark a part of a sound. It sets the in and out points, and with Multiple selections on it becomes one of the selections — so what you mark up on the waveform is what the timeline shows.</li>
<li>Each mark also gets a gain region, ready to pull up or down.</li>
<li>Removing a selection now removes its gain region too, instead of leaving a level applied to nothing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
